1
00:00:00,589 --> 00:00:02,759
(Sheldon:)Leonard would never
go swimming in public

2
00:00:02,757 --> 00:00:05,057
(Sheldon:)without his swim shirt.

3
00:00:06,294 --> 00:00:07,594
(Amy:)I'm sure he brought it.

4
00:00:07,596 --> 00:00:09,596
(Sheldon:)No, but last year,
at Magic Mountain,

5
00:00:09,598 --> 00:00:11,128
(Sheldon:)he got such a bad sunburn,

6
00:00:11,132 --> 00:00:13,902
(Sheldon:)we had to cut him out of it.

7
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,270
(Amy:)He probably got a new one.
Finish your breakfast.

8
00:00:17,272 --> 00:00:19,102
(Amy:)Look, there's an entire
section of my dashboard

9
00:00:19,107 --> 00:00:20,837
(Amy:)that doesn't have
any syrup on it.

10
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:24,840
(Sheldon:)You're acting odd. Why?

11
00:00:24,846 --> 00:00:27,946
(Amy:)I'm odd all the time,
everyone knows that.

12
00:00:27,949 --> 00:00:29,349
(Amy:)Just last night,

13
00:00:29,351 --> 00:00:32,251
(Amy:)I tried to see how many fava
beans I could fit in my mouth.

14
00:00:33,989 --> 00:00:35,119
(Sheldon:)Tell me the truth.

15
00:00:35,123 --> 00:00:37,793
28.
Come on.

16
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:40,462
Fifty-six.

17
00:00:40,462 --> 00:00:41,692
Amy!

18
00:00:41,696 --> 00:00:44,126
(Sheldon:)What's going on?

19
00:00:44,132 --> 00:00:45,962
(Amy:)All right.

20
00:00:45,967 --> 00:00:47,297
(Amy:)Don't get upset, but...

21
00:00:47,302 --> 00:00:50,642
(Amy:)an earlier appointment
opened up for Leonard

22
00:00:50,639 --> 00:00:54,069
(Amy:)and he's getting
the surgery right now.

23
00:00:57,812 --> 00:01:05,022
(Sheldon:)I see.

